    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍺🍺这个冬春之交，我有个巨大的转变：从每月必旅行的外向探索者，变成一个季度都不出城的死宅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>行为表现的背后到底发生了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我带着强烈的好奇心，展开了又一场与自我的对话，去到了新的「观景台」品味生命的层次。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎧收听指引</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>旅行之外的新鲜感来源？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a>】学习左手使筷子</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a>】搭错公交之后的奇遇</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a>】一分钱没花，DIY了一个工作台</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如何做到”允许“意外发生？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a>】 贝叶斯公式、</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MNfsBAExv/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=5929e81ad1d9bcb64b7a79904dec4d65" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MNfsBAExv/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=5929e81ad1d9bcb64b7a79904dec4d65"><span>打坐</span></a><span>和人性</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a>】完美主义是个美丽的谎言</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a>】成为一个</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/25782902/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/25782902/"><span>反脆弱</span></a><span>的人</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>BGM 陈绮贞《偶然与巧合》</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>📼🍺</span><strong><span>关于节目</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>通过一点点声音叙事，展示音乐和心灵碰撞时的化学反应，矛盾、模糊、跳跃但绝对真诚的思想旅程。请相信音乐能带我们直面自己、找到出口。</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务/合作请通过邮箱 &nbsp;coladsalt@163.com 联系，期待你的来信呀~</span></p>]]></description>
